{"2747780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dishwashing Simulator", "steam_appid": 2747780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Experience the unexpected thrill of a household chore in the latest next-generation AAAAA simulation experience: Dishwashing Simulator. New ground has been broken in the simulation genre, with a never-before-seen level of detail in the act of washing dishes. Explore a simulated world where every dish matters and survival hinges on your ability to keep things clean. Navigate through a twisted cycle of chores, rewards, and mysteries as you uncover the secrets behind your menial tasks.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Immerse yourself in an emergent simulation where gameplay mechanics interact in unpredictable ways.<br></li><li> Engage with an immersive physical interaction system.<br></li><li> Explore &quot;The Depths,&quot;  a procedurally generated dungeon.<br></li><li> Run, hide, and learn to survive various anomalies.<br></li><li> Light automation mechanics<br></li><li> Construct your base and production line, optimizing your dishwashing operations.<br></li><li> Survive by managing food, water, and agriculture.<br></li><li> Research using scrap to gain buffs or upgrades.<br></li><li> Unravel a short, but cryptic narrative.<br></li><li> <strong>GAMBLING !</strong></li></ul><br><strong>Heads up: Dishwashing Simulator is NOT a full-blown automation game! It is a short-ish (4-6 hours) narrative survival horror game with some lite automation mechanics; don't expect a deep tech tree and hundreds of hours of gameplay!</strong>", "about_the_game": "Experience the unexpected thrill of a household chore in the latest next-generation AAAAA simulation experience: Dishwashing Simulator. New ground has been broken in the simulation genre, with a never-before-seen level of detail in the act of washing dishes. Explore a simulated world where every dish matters and survival hinges on your ability to keep things clean. Navigate through a twisted cycle of chores, rewards, and mysteries as you uncover the secrets behind your menial tasks.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Immerse yourself in an emergent simulation where gameplay mechanics interact in unpredictable ways.<br></li><li> Engage with an immersive physical interaction system.<br></li><li> Explore &quot;The Depths,&quot;  a procedurally generated dungeon.<br></li><li> Run, hide, and learn to survive various anomalies.<br></li><li> Light automation mechanics<br></li><li> Construct your base and production line, optimizing your dishwashing operations.<br></li><li> Survive by managing food, water, and agriculture.<br></li><li> Research using scrap to gain buffs or upgrades.<br></li><li> Unravel a short, but cryptic narrative.<br></li><li> <strong>GAMBLING !</strong></li></ul><br><strong>Heads up: Dishwashing Simulator is NOT a full-blown automation game! It is a short-ish (4-6 hours) narrative survival horror game with some lite automation mechanics; don't expect a deep tech tree and hundreds of hours of gameplay!</strong>", "short_description": "A short, unique survival-farming-base-building-tycoon-horror game where you must survive through washing dishes. Explore mysterious depths, manage resources, and unravel a cryptic narrative. In DWS, a chore becomes a journey to freedom.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747780/header.jpg?t=1773942580", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773942580", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773942580", "website": "https://frinky.org/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br>